    "content": "build tags go:build GOOS trung cấp // file: myfile_linux.go (tự động cho Linux) // file: myfile_windows.go (tự động cho Windows) // Mỗi file chỉ có tối đa một //go:build line // file: math_linux_amd64.go //go:build linux \u0026amp;\u0026amp; amd64 // file: purego.go //go:build !cgo // file: go126plus.go //go:build go1.26 // file: integration_test.go //go:build integration // go test -tags=integration ./... // Toolchain directives //go:generate go run gen.go //go:noinline //go:nosplit //go:linkname localname importpath.name",
    "html": "\u003cdiv class=\"topic-card\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"topic-header\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"topic-name\"\u003eBuild tags \u0026 conditional compilation\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"topic-desc\"\u003e//go:build, OS/arch-specific files, toolchain directives\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chevron\"\u003e▼\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"topic-detail\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tag-list\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"tag\"\u003ebuild tags\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"tag\"\u003ego:build\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"tag\"\u003eGOOS\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"level-badge level-inter\"\u003etrung cấp\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cpre\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-go\"\u003e// file: myfile_linux.go (tự động cho Linux)\n// file: myfile_windows.go (tự động cho Windows)\n\n// Mỗi file chỉ có tối đa một //go:build line\n\n// file: math_linux_amd64.go\n//go:build linux \u0026amp;\u0026amp; amd64\n\n// file: purego.go\n//go:build !cgo\n\n// file: go126plus.go\n//go:build go1.26\n\n// file: integration_test.go\n//go:build integration\n// go test -tags=integration ./...\n\n// Toolchain directives\n//go:generate go run gen.go\n//go:noinline\n//go:nosplit\n//go:linkname localname importpath.name\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e"
